From 7d1aa46a927993a53f78885bcf83dff9ed950394 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Assistant <user@example.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Apr 2026 14:29:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(web): instant-save WebTab with bidirectional config
 sync

Web settings now apply immediately on every change (toggle, blur, Enter)
instead of requiring explicit save. Added Rust-side IPC dispatchers for
get_web_server_status and update_and_apply_web (with server restart logic).
Frontend uses appliedConfigRef to track committed state separately from
input state, and propagates changes back to SettingsModal's localConfig.
configStore.updateConfig now preserves latest web config to prevent
overwrite when saving other settings tabs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
